Y['ecosize-cxw-111'] = dict(
 tips=['Run the trial on one construction first, ideally the one with the highest break rate, so the improvement is easy to see.','Record warp breaks per 100,000 picks for a week before the trial to have a fair baseline.','Keep size box temperature and viscosity logs during the trial; consistent cooking is as important as the product.','Check desizing on the first fabric lot so preparation is confirmed alongside weaving.','Once results are proven, move other constructions one at a time rather than all at once.'],
 pk='Pakistani weaving mills run long shifts on mixed fleets of older shuttleless and newer air-jet looms, often with cotton and polyester-cotton yarn from several spinners. Recipes that worked on one yarn lot can behave differently on the next. A single, pre-balanced sizing powder reduces one source of variation in that environment, and the 25 KG bag or 100 KG drum suits both small sizing departments and large integrated mills in Faisalabad and Lahore.',
 faq3=[('Can EcoSize-CXW-111 help with high break rates in summer?','Hot, dry conditions raise breaks in many halls. A good size film helps, and humidity control in the weaving hall matters too.'),('Who supports the trial?','The Seamens technical team supports the trial, from recipe set-up to reviewing loom results.')])
Y['ecoshort-gs-777'] = dict(
 tips=['Replace PVA powder step by step on one beam before switching the whole recipe.','Watch shed opening and fly at the loom; better lubrication shows there first.','Confirm desizing with an iodine test on the first lot.','Store the paste covered and out of direct sun to keep it consistent.','Use the poster and product sheet to brief size kitchen staff on the new recipe.'],
 pk='Many Pakistani mills still rely on imported PVA powders whose price moves with the rupee and freight costs. A paste that replaces PVA powder while also lubricating and binding gives purchase teams a simpler line item and size kitchens fewer separate additions, which matters when several shifts share one kitchen.',
 faq3=[('Is EcoShort-GS-777 suitable for air-jet looms?','Loom type is considered during the trial; the recipe is confirmed on your looms.'),('Can I see the product poster?','Yes, the EcoShort-GS-777 poster is shown at the top of this page; tap it to view full size.')])
Y['ecosoftener-d-11'] = dict(
 tips=['Tell Seamens every chemical in the bath so the right ionic quality is chosen.','Add the softener at the stage and temperature recommended for your process.','For towels, test absorbency alongside handle on every trial lot.','Keep a reference handle sample signed off by the buyer.','Avoid mixing qualities in one bath unless advised.'],
 pk='Pakistan is one of the world\'s largest exporters of towels and home textiles, and buyers judge both softness and absorbency. A softener that gives a soft hand in finishing while also replacing tello in sizing serves both the weaving and finishing sides of these export mills.',
 faq3=[('Can D-11 help export towel orders?','It gives a soft hand; for towels, absorbency is tested in the trial so softness does not cost absorbency.'),('Is D-11 the same as a silicone softener?','No. D-11 is a softening paste that also replaces tello in sizing; silicone softeners are the Eco-SilSoftner grades.')])
Y['ecoacryllic-acl-55'] = dict(
 tips=['Start with your heaviest denim or canvas construction, where abrasion is highest.','Measure size add-on carefully; ACL-55 is designed to protect at low add-on.','Watch for gumming on indigo lines during the first days.','Check desizing results before denim wash processing.','Use the 1,000 KG tank for high-volume denim units to simplify handling.'],
 pk='Pakistan\'s denim sector supplies major international brands and runs heavy indigo-dyed warps on demanding looms. Gumming and high size add-on slow these lines and load the desizing step. A size built for abrasion resistance at low add-on with easy removal supports the throughput these export units depend on.',
 faq3=[('Is ACL-55 used for towel sizing?','Yes. For towel it gives high strength, a soft hand, low foam and economical use.'),('Does ACL-55 work for sacking and bags?','Bags, sacking and low count cotton are listed applications.')])
